## Objectif

Verify the assigned draft pull request meets the readiness criteria
required by the project policy and, if every gate is met, flip it from
draft to ready-for-review. The orchestrator has authorized this task
with mutation scope `{{MUTATION_SCOPE}}` (which includes `pr_state`
because flipping draft/ready is an external PR state change).

- pr-ops-task: mark_ready_candidate
- external-pr-mutations: {{MUTATION_SCOPE}}

