## Format de sortie attendu

Either (a) `gh pr ready {{PR_NUMBER}} --repo {{REPO}}` after every
readiness gate is green, plus a short status report enumerating each
gate and its verdict; or (b) a structured blocker recording exactly
which gate refused the flip. Do not merge, do not push commits, do
not edit labels/assignees, do not change the PR title or body.

## Tools / sources autorises

- `cd {{AGENT_WORKDIR}}` (always first)
- Read-only inspection of the PR via `gh pr view {{PR_NUMBER}} --json
  state,mergeable,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup,isDraft`
- Verification: `{{VERIFICATION_COMMANDS}}` (must pass before flip)
- Audit evidence: `record_local_gate_evidence` from `lib/audit_log.sh`
  before the flip, with one entry per gate (CI, mergeable, review,
  hotspots, deploy gate)
- The flip itself: `gh pr ready {{PR_NUMBER}} --repo {{REPO}}` —
  authorised under scope `pr_state` only

## Readiness gates (every gate must be MET to flip)

- CI rollup status equals `pass` (no failed, pending, or missing checks)
- `mergeable` equals `MERGEABLE` (refuse on `UNKNOWN` or `CONFLICTING`)
- `mergeStateStatus` is one of `CLEAN`, `HAS_HOOKS`, `UNSTABLE`
  (refuse on `BLOCKED`, `DIRTY`, `BEHIND`, `UNKNOWN`)
- No coordination-surface hotspot conflicts open against other agents
- No deploy-gate-external-wait signal on this PR

## Boundaries / interdictions

- Merge policy boundary: {{MERGE_POLICY}} — do NOT merge from this task.
- Out of scope: pushing commits, rebasing, editing PR title/body,
  changing assignees/labels/reviewers, requesting reviews.
- No `--no-verify`, `--admin`, `gh pr merge`, or any mutation scope
  beyond `{{MUTATION_SCOPE}}`.
- Refuse the flip and record a structured blocker if any gate is
  unmet. Agents must NEVER flip ready-for-review on a draft whose CI
  is pending or red.

## Definition of Done verifiable

- [ ] `pwd` post-cd inside `{{AGENT_WORKDIR}}`
- [ ] Every gate above is recorded as MET in the audit evidence
      OR a blocker is filed naming the unmet gate
- [ ] No PR mutation outside `{{MUTATION_SCOPE}}`
- [ ] If flipped: PR shows `isDraft=false` and the resulting
      `mergeStateStatus` is reported

